<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#2A2166">
<title>Privacy Policy — Class 10 Papers Solved</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --indigo: #2a2166;
    --indigo2: #41337f;
    --amber: #d9a43a;
    --amber2: #f0c36b;
    --bg: #faf8f4;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --line: #eae4f0;
    --text: #241c4e;
    --muted: #6f6a8a;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }a
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }
  .top {
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--indigo2), var(--indigo));
    color: #fff;
    padding: 44px 24px 40px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .top::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -90px;
    right: -80px;
    width: 260px;
    height: 260px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(240, 195, 107, .28), transparent 66%);
  }
  .wrap { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .mark {
    width: 46px;
    height: 46px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .2);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--amber2);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -.5px;
  }
  .brand b { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.2px; }
  .brand span { display: block; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .65); font-weight: 600; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(24px, 5vw, 32px); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.6px; line-height: 1.25; }
  .meta {
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .16);
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .8);
  }
  .meta i {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--amber2);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  main { max-width: 780px; margin: -18px auto 0; padding: 0 18px 56px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 38px);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(42, 33, 102, .08);
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.2px;
    margin: 32px 0 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  h2:first-of-type { margin-top: 4px; }
  h2::before {
    content: "";
    width: 5px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: var(--amber);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  p { font-size: 14px; color: #3a3360; margin: 10px 0; }
  ul { margin: 10px 0 10px 4px; list-style: none; }
  li {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #3a3360;
    padding-left: 22px;
    position: relative;
    margin: 7px 0;
  }
  li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 2px;
    top: 9px;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--amber);
  }
  .note {
    background: #faf6ec;
    border: 1px solid #f0e2be;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    margin: 18px 0;
  }
  .note p { margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b5a22; }
  .note b { color: #4a3c12; }
  a { color: var(--indigo); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(217, 164, 58, .55); }
  a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--amber); }
  .contact {
    margin-top: 18px;
    background: linear-gradient(150deg, #41337f, #2a2166);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 22px 22px;
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .contact h3 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 3px; }
  .contact p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .64); font-size: 11.5px; margin: 0; font-weight: 600; }
  .contact a {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: #241c4e;
    border: none;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .contact a:hover { background: var(--amber2); }
  footer {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 22px 20px 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #171329;
      --surface: #221c42;
      --line: #332a5e;
      --text: #f2eff8;
      --muted: #9c96be;
    }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); }
    p, li { color: #d6d1e8; }
    .note { background: #2a2440; border-color: #3a3252; }
    .note p { color: #cfc6a6; }
    .note b { color: #efe3c2; }
    a { color: var(--amber2); }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="mark">10</div>
        <div>
          <b>Class 10 Papers Solved</b>
          <span>CBSE papers &amp; solutions</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="meta"><i></i> Last updated: 2 November 2026</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Class 10 Papers Solved is an independent study app that helps students browse
        Class 10 CBSE previous year question papers and their official solutions.
        This policy explains what information the app does and does not handle.
      </p>
      <div class="note">
        <p><b>Short version:</b> the app collects no personal information. There are no
        accounts, no analytics, no ads and no trackers. The only network access is to
        download the PDF files you choose.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>The app does <b>not</b> collect, store, transmit or share any personal information.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>No account, sign-in or profile is required.</li>
        <li>No analytics, crash reporting, advertising or tracking SDKs are included.</li>
        <li>No access to contacts, photos, camera, microphone, location or external files.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Permissions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Internet</b> — used only to download the PDF files you choose. PDFs are hosted on a public third-party server.</li>
        <li>No storage or media permissions are requested. Downloaded PDFs are stored in the app's private storage on your device.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Downloads and data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Files you download stay on your device inside the app's private folder.</li>
        <li>You can delete individual files or clear all downloads from the Downloads or Settings screen at any time.</li>
        <li>Uninstalling the app removes all downloaded files.</li>
        <li>On the web version, PDF links open in a new browser tab and only a local list of opened links is kept in your browser storage.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third-party content</h2>
      <p>
        Question papers and solutions are published by CBSE and are provided for study
        purposes. PDF files are hosted on an external server; your device connects
        directly to that server when you download a paper. This app is not affiliated with,
        endorsed by, or connected to CBSE.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The app does not collect any data from any user, including children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes, the updated version will be published with a new app
        release at this same address.
      </p>

      <div class="contact">
        <div>
          <h3>Questions about this policy?</h3>
          <p>We usually reply within 2 working days.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:asnstudios.app@gmail.com?subject=Class%2010%20Papers%20Solved%20%E2%80%94%20Privacy">Email us</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
      Class 10 Papers Solved &bull; asnstudios.app@gmail.com<br>
      Question papers and solutions belong to CBSE. This is an independent, unofficial study app.
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
